# FINAL VIVA QUESTIONS

---

# What is EC2?

Virtual machine in AWS cloud.

---

# What is SSH?

Secure remote login protocol.

Uses port 22.

---

# What is SCP?

Secure file transfer over SSH.

---

# Why chmod 400?

To secure private key permissions.

---

# Why use Private IP between instances?

Because both instances are inside same VPC network.

---

# What is Security Group?

Firewall controlling traffic.

---

# Difference Between Public and Private IP?

| Public IP | Private IP |
| --- | --- |
| Internet accessible | Internal communication |
| Used from laptop | Used between EC2s |
